===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} ''[[zweinzug]]'' from an original *''tweintug'', from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} *''twaintigaz'', {{m|gem-pro|*twai tigiwiz}}. Compare Dutch ''[[twintig]]'', West Frisian {{m|fy|tweintich}}, English ''[[twenty]]'', Danish {{m|da|tyve}}.

